  (the full text is in LICENSE-GRAPHICS).

Changes: each graphic is converted to an indexed-color PNG, centered on a
76x72 canvas and packed into a font with color bitmap tables (CBDT and CBLC),
with ligature rules for the emoji sequences. The graphics are otherwise
unchanged.

